Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:03.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我開動了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.22,0:00:05.53,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,開凍了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:21.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,便當有了 零食有了 水壺有了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:23.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還要尿布和替換的衣物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:25.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就行了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.49,0:00:26.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:28.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 畢竟是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是命運之子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.41,0:00:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定能拯救藍天大地於毀滅的危難之中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.41,0:00:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(865,970)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:40.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們卻給她吃很普通的飯菜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:41.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,行嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.84,0:00:43.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.31,0:00:46.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學親手做的飯菜可好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:48.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,但是啊但是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:50.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是應該要更豪華點的啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:56.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就算做那麼多 小空喜歡的就只有飯糰和香蕉吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.65,0:01:01.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你要這麼說 這還是我弟弟小時候穿的...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:04.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是該讓她穿更豪華的禮服啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:07.54,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天出去玩 穿方便活動的衣服就好...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:10.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯麗 真白...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.30,0:01:14.60,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:19.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我一想到公主是命運之子 一定要保護好她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:22.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一件一件的 就穿著這樣了...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.79,0:01:26.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 準備好了... 欸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.33,0:01:32.71,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你們搞什麼？最近流行這種？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:35.80,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}興奮不已！小公主 去動物園！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:17.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 都想太多了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.15,0:03:22.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,聽到命運之子 確實是會變得緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.75,0:03:25.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空跟以前又沒什麼變化
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.17,0:03:27.55,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:28.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:32.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然心裡明白 卻還是...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你們看 已經到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:38.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,天窗市自然公園！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\frz2.818\pos(1220,275)}{\fs50\c&HDDCE5D&\3c&H000000&\3a&HFF&}天窗市自然公園 動物園
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.02,0:03:44.58,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,然後 寶寶就是吉祥物的霸天龍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:46.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:51.20,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嘎哦 怕怕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:53.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不怕不怕 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:55.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡有很多動物 可好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:57.78,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,動嗚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:04:02.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很期待見到 之前隻在圖鑑上看到過的動物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:05.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我很期待吃便當
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.60,0:04:08.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈 大伙都勁頭十足呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:12.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那就趕快去見動物們吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.49,0:04:14.21,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,走！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:19.05,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！是水豚！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.81,0:04:22.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,水豚正在泡澡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:25.20,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,洗澡澡 泡泡泡泡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:28.36,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,水豚悠然自得 很可愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:33.43,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？怎麼過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.53,0:04:36.78,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:39.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,水水 飯飯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:40.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:41.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.89,0:04:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(838,193)}{\fs50\3c&H000000&\3a&HFF&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&}水豚的零食
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:44.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是在跟我們要吃的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:47.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會靠近我們的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.58,0:04:52.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 為什麼小空會知道水豚餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:55.38,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主 請用
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:57.54,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:04:59.70,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,請用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:04.11,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,水水 好吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:10.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:13.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼動物啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.67,0:05:16.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有種噼喲的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:18.57,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害 是真的大象
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:21.84,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大象鼻子的功能 就跟人的手一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:24.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:29.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了！那匹馬的脖子伸長了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:32.83,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 是長頸鹿！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:37.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是為了吃到高處的葉子 才進化出長脖子的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.55,0:05:41.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊世界的動物真是不可思議呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:47.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！那種馬很像藍天大地的條紋馬呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:49.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是顏色不同
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:52.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,條紋馬是藍白相交的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:53.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,藍白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:54.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.53,0:05:58.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,因為藍天大地位於天上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:03.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,毛色保持和天空相同的話 就不容易讓其他動物發現
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:06.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還有其他很多種的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:11.31,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對我們來說 藍天大地的動物才不可思議呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:13.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好像見一見呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.72,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,來來 來來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:27.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真... 真的過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:32.17,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,象象 長鹿 斑紋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:40.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,在跟公主打招呼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.30,0:06:45.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,難道說... 這邊世界的動物也很喜歡小寶寶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.79,0:06:47.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然有這個可能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:51.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定小空是真的能跟動物交流
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:56.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇... 這麼一說 我也有想要交流的動物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:01.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,百獸之王 獅子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:03.78,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 在睡覺呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.01,0:07:05.46,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,睡覺覺
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:08.75,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,獅子醒著才比較稀奇吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.46,0:07:13.46,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是夜行性的 也就是在夜晚活動的動物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:16.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,所以白天的時候 基本都在睡覺
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.19,0:07:19.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 醒了 醒過來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:24.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.37,0:07:27.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊呀 魄力十足！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:31.49,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主 你知道獅子剛才在說什麼嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:34.41,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,獅子 憤憤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:37.91,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,睡覺覺 噓
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.57,0:07:41.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 獅子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.51,0:07:43.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:49.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:51.32,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,開凍！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.44,0:07:57.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,鮭魚 米飯 海苔 還有藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:08:00.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真是最佳搭配的美味
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.53,0:08:03.41,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,飯糰團 好糍！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:08.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空好像真的能夠動物交流呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:12.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,以後 還會掌握更多不同的能力吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:14.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,有這個可能
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:17.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,就現在知道的 能讓我們成為Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.06,0:08:20.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,有著不可思議的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.49,0:08:24.82,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定能夠飛行...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:27.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,變得力氣很大！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.41,0:08:29.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,能從眼睛射出光線
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.18,0:08:36.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那... 那種就實在是大能耐小寶寶了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:40.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是應該從現在開始 實施精英教育啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.63,0:08:42.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,飯菜也需要更講究！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:45.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要學習烹飪了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:47.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:49.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:55.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到啊 這麼早就到了 給小空傳授藍天神拳的時候...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:58.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這還為時過早吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:09:00.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 冷靜一點！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:02.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你們又進入多慮模式了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.99,0:09:04.26,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.43,0:09:07.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 小蝶是怎麼想的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:10.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:13.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:15.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:19.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,即使她不是公主或者命運之子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:23.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸媽媽 我們大伙也會為她煩惱的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:25.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是... 這樣的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.06,0:09:27.36,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:32.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,給她讀什麼畫書好？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,給她吃什麼好？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:37.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,要慣著她？還是不慣著？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.58,0:09:39.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,培養小孩子的長處
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:42.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,希望孩子能夠成長為優秀的大人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.68,0:09:44.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,人們都是一邊煩惱著 一邊養育孩子的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.93,0:09:50.44,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,痛痛嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:53.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.11,0:09:58.59,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,痛痛的 痛痛的 飛走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:04.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:09.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝小公主 痛痛的 已經飛到了天空的盡頭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.77,0:10:11.90,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,不渴氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:17.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再讓小空為我們操心了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:22.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 吃好便當 繼續去看動物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:26.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那麼接下來去撫摸區吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:32.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,9996！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:35.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,9997！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:38.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,9998！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.75,0:10:40.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,9999！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:46.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,1萬！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:50.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 熱身運動就做到這裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.10,0:10:55.78,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,已經等得太久了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:11:00.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,終於等來了 夠格與吾一戰的勁敵了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:06.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 尖角利齒 來碰一下吧 Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(1885,1069)}{\fs50}撫摸動物區\N大家友好相處
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:24.83,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 兔兔 好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:27.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,要溫柔地摸摸它哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.58,0:11:29.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好... 好暖和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:31.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好小一隻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:36.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗地叫著 噗噗的叫聲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:39.39,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（腳步聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:55.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,突然怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.59,0:11:57.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好像在害怕什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.41,0:12:00.84,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,兔兔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:04.84,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,兔兔...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.44,0:12:07.87,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.69,0:12:10.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,外面可能發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:12.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去看看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.29,0:12:13.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:16.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.95,0:12:27.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,一看便知 那位嬰孩便是天空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:31.07,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼你們就是Precure吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.49,0:12:33.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:35.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吾名彌諾彤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.41,0:12:37.58,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,為暗塌谷帝國效命之人！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.81,0:12:42.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是為了搶公主 新派來的刺客嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:46.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫彌諾彤... 是卡疤痛的哥哥嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:50.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,別把我和那種低級惡劣的蠢貨 相提並論！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:52.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:54.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃懶做 用放屁來戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.93,0:12:57.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,臭不可聞 愧對武人名號！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:59.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛好像是禁語
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.20,0:13:04.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吾才是真武人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.19,0:13:08.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure啊 來與吾的亂暴獸切磋一下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.49,0:13:13.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:24.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.63,0:13:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.48,0:13:30.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:31.27,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:35.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！你都對霸天龍做了什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:36.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,遊客們有危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:38.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要保護他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:39.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
